<p class="ah-prose-p">And, of course, you&#x27;ll get invited to my private AI Hero Discord, with an exclusive channel for you to meet &amp; learn along with your fellow attendees.</p>
<p class="ah-prose-p">This way, you get the best of sync and async courses in one great experience.</p>
