sm leading-relaxed flex gap-2.5 text-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2.4,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"mt-[3px] size-4 flex-none text-[color:var(--ah-mark-yes)]\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"polyline\",\"10jjfj\",{\"points\":\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\"Strategic Thinker: your time goes to the strategic thinking that really matters\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Skillful Delegator: well-spec'd work goes to a system you can trust\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed flex gap-2.5 text-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2.4,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"mt-[3px] size-4 flex-none text-[color:var(--ah-mark-yes)]\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"polyline\",\"10jjfj\",{\"points\":\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\"Skillful Delegator: well-spec'd work goes to a system you can trust\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Real Engineer: you wrap up the day relaxed and satisfied\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed flex gap-2.5 text-foreground\",\"children\":[\"$Lac\",\"Real Engineer: you wrap up the day relaxed and satisfied\"]}]]}]]}]]}]]\n44:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"It's not easy or obvious how to get to this level. It's certainly not a feature of coding agent harnesses: \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"/goal\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}],\" simply will not get the job done.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n45:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"And most of the folks who talk about closing thousands of tickets in a month work at AI labs or companies with unlimited tokens. It seems like even when it \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"works\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\", it's still a fantasy.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n46:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"But this is an engineering problem. And you're an engineer.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n47:[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$39:props:children:props:children:24:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"role\":\"separator\",\"className\":\"ah-divider\"}]]\n48:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"I've already helped thousands of engineers like you apply a Real Engineering approach to AI coding, achieving excellent quality using my Real Engineering Loop. And this is a fantastic approach for new projects, exploratory work, and highly complex moving parts.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n49:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"But it's not necessary for more mundane stuff like stacks of tickets. That's where a Software Factory approach can really shine.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"I've built and battle-tested a working Software Factory.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And in my brand new 2-week cohort course, you'll learn how to do it for yourself.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"$Lad\",null,{\"urls\":{\"dark\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1791797672/cohorts/cohort-xdy1m/calendar-dark.png\",\"light\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1791798296/cohorts/cohort-xdy1m/calendar-light.png\"},\"alt\":\"Calendar for November 2026 with the two weeks of the cohort, November 9 to 20, highlighted\",\"width\":737,\"height\":380,\"className\":\"mx-auto hidden sm:block\"}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"$Lad\",null,{\"urls\":{\"dark\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1791797937/cohorts/cohort-xdy1m/calendar-dark-mobile.png\",\"light\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1791798297/cohorts/cohort-xdy1m/calendar-light-mobile.png\"},\"alt\":\"Calendar for November 2026 with the two weeks of the cohort, November 9 to 20, highlighted\",\"width\":407,\"height\":380,\"className\":\"mx-auto sm:hidden\"}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"$Lae\",null,{\"cohort\":\"$3a:props:cohort\",\"availableBonuses\":\"$3a:props:children:2:props:availableBonuses\",\"purchaseCount\":1573,\"quantityAvailable\":-1,\"totalQuantity\":0,\"product\":\"$10:props:children:props:children:4:props:product\",\"pricingDataLoader\":\"$@ab\",\"hasPurchasedCurrentProduct\":false,\"existingPurchase\":null,\"purchases\":\"$3a:props:children:2:props:purchases\",\"products\":\"$3a:props:children:2:props:products\",\"allowPurchase\":true,\"country\":\"JP\",\"organizationId\":null,\"options\":{\"withTitle\":false,\"withImage\":false},\"userId\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"not-prose my-8 items-center justify-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Laf\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lb0\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 relative h-auto w-full cursor-pointer rounded-lg px-8 font-semibold sm:h-14 sm:w-auto md:px-16\",\"trailing\":[\"$\",\"$Lb1\",null,{}],\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative z-10 sm:hidden\",\"children\":\"Enroll\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative z-10 hidden sm:inline\",\"children\":\"Join Now\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"backgroundSize\":\"200% 100%\"},\"className\":\"animate-shine pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(255,255,255,0)40%,rgba(255,255,255,1)50%,rgba(255,255,255,0)60%)] opacity-10 dark:opacity-20\"}]]}]}]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"level\":2,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Software Factories for Real Engineers\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" kicks off on Monday November 9th. Join today.\"]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"My newest 2-week async cohort course is redesigned from the ground up, and it's all designed for you to apply to your real-world projects.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n51:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You'll learn how to build an end-to-end system you can trust. You'll learn how to explore, specify, and document large chunks of work to your agent, and have it work, persistently and thoroughly, until it's done. You'll learn how to set up a series of guardrails and cross-checks like hooks to enforce code quality and automated adversarial review.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n52:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Instead of playing endless chase and catch-up on your stacks of PRs, you'll be able to delegate with confidence.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n53:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your Software Factory will even help you improve your codebase over time. Agents, after all, never get tired or bored, and they have no egos.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n54:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"That's how you can wrap up your work day feeling relaxed and satisfied instead of feeling like your brains got scooped out by a melon baller.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n55:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You'll learn how to build a Software Factory tuned for you, your codebase, your team, your needs, and your standards. Which is no problem when you approach it like you'd design any new system: like a Real Engineer.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n56:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":[\"So what do you need to build a real, functioning, \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"economical\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" Software Factory for you and your team, to expand and improve your existing codebase?\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n57:[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[\"17911765743379834197\"]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"ah-factory-map not-prose @container my-10\",\"style\":{\"--flow-loop\":\"12s\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"figcaption\",nul