"d\":\"M255 26L247 30.5L247 21.5Z\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"stroke\":\"none\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M168 128L168 36Q168 26 178 26L247 26\",\"className\":\"ah-factory-pulse text-foreground\",\"style\":{\"--flow-length\":\"177.2px\",\"animationTimingFunction\":\"linear(0, 0.000 17.04%, 0.180 18.48%, 0.344 19.91%, 0.492 21.35%, 0.625 22.79%, 0.742 24.23%, 0.844 25.66%, 0.930 27.10%, 1.000 28.54%, 1)\"}}],[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M255 26L247 30.5L247 21.5Z\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"stroke\":\"none\",\"className\":\"ah-factory-flash text-foreground\",\"style\":{\"animationDelay\":\"3.24s\"}}],\"$Lb2\"]}],\"$Lb3\",\"$Lb4\",\"$Lb5\"]}],\"$Lb6\",\"$Lb7\",\"$Lb8\",\"$Lb9\",\"$Lba\",\"$Lbb\"]}]]}],\"$Lbc\",\"$Lbd\"]}]]\n58:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"The goal of any software factory is \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"speed\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". You and your team want to go fast. You want to delegate more work to the agent. And you want to get more done.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n59:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"So most folks start building \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"accelerators\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". They start “loop engineering”, building systems that trigger work without human intervention. They start building \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"infrastructure\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" to connect their agents to data sources, and to run them in sandboxes.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"But speed without quality and control is how we end up with even more heaps of slop to clean up. That's why starting with accelerators is backwards.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Before you can trust your agent to go fast, you need to know that the quality of work is going to be high at any speed. You’ve gotta know how to use the brakes.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And the best brakes are the ones we’ve always had: codebase design, testing, adding guardrails to code. Applying the knowledge our industry has developed over the last 50 years.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"In this cohort, we’ll spend \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"a lot\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" of our time learning and building your Software Factory's brakes.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You will…\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5f:[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Learn how to create and document the knowledge\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" needed to keep everybody on the same page: ubiquitous language, the project map, ADRs, specs and tickets, and ever-improving code.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Create coding standards\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". From guidance through written instructions, to enforcement through tests, linters, type checks, automated review, and more.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Build 3 layers of safety and sanity checks\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\": automated checks, automated review, and human review (when your priorities call for it, with incredibly readable PRs).\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Make your codebase better than it's ever been before.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" For you, your team, your users, and your coding agents, using the Software Factory you've engineered and built.\"]}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-numbers\"}]\n60:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You'll build a real, working Software Factory just like the one I work with every day, using a provided example code base (keeping your own codebase safe until you’re confident).\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Then, you'll practice designing your own for \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"your\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" codebase, \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"your\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" team and \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"your\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" needs.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And by the end, you’ll know how to develop your custom brakes and steering systems that support your engineering choices, preferences, and goals.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n63:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"No more chasing bugs:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" your factory triages them for you.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n64:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"No more babysitting:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" your agents report back when work is done, or when they need your input.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n65:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And best of all, no more brain fry, so you can spend more of your precious brain juice thinking about building great software.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n66:[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$39:props:children:props:children:24:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"role\":\"separator\",\"className\":\"ah-divider\"}]]\n67:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"level\":2,\"children\":\"Full Schedule: What you'll be learning, doing, and building each week\"}]\n68:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"On day one, you'll get full access to all of the lessons, letting you pick your pace and schedule. Rip through lessons, or take your time; revisit to make sure you understand, and bring questions to Office Hours!\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n69:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"For the best experience, here's my \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"recommended\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" schedule that starts the moment you join, and continues through both weeks of the cohort:\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Before We Begin: AI Coding Crash Course (Included Free)\"}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"To help you hit the ground running on Day 1, once you enroll you'll get immediate access to my \",[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/workshops/ai-coding-crash-course\",\"title\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-a\",\"children\":\"AI Coding Crash Course\"}],\".\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"I launched this self-guided course over the summer to help folks get up to speed on the fundamentals of working with AI coding agents as quickly as possible: how AI models work, how coding harnesses work, and the importance of your agent’s environment.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"$Lad\",null,{\"urls\":{\"light\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1786640502/workshops/ai-coding-crash-course/iceberg-light.png\",\"dark\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1786640503/workshops/ai-coding-crash-course/iceberg-dark.png\"},\"width\":480,\"height\":600,\"alt\":\"Iceberg diagram: great, reliable, predictable results above the waterline; how models work, how harnesses work, and your agent's environment beneath it\",\"className\":\"mx-auto my-8 w-full max-w-md rounded-md\"}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Even if you’re already using AI coding agents every day, you do not want to skip this Crash Course!\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Treat it as a prerequisite for getting the most out of the cohort itself.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You can complete the Crash Course end to end in roughly three days, or use it as reference material to fill in the gaps you need the most.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n70:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The lessons and exercises inside will make sure you have all of the knowledge and understanding to build your own Software Factory.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n71:[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$39:props:children:props:children:24:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"role\":\"separator\",\"className\":\"ah-divider\"}]]\n72:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Week 1: From Domain Language to Codebase Design\"}]\n73:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Kick off the cohort with a live Office Hours, giving you a chance to ask me your burning questions \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"before\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" you begin.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n74:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Then jump right in by getting you and your agent speaking the same language. You'll build a shared glossary and write ADRs with \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"/grill-with-docs\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}],\", so your agents (and your teammates) stop misunderstanding what you mean.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Next, learn to plan work far too big for one agent session. With the Wayfinder skill, you'll chart a map of the work, grill and prototype the risky parts, and turn it into specs your factory can build.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n76:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"After that, focus on the best ways to create and use the brakes that will keep your agent in your control. You'll learn the three kinds of review, how to make human review faster and how to prioritize it, and how to run a retro that improves the system that wrote the code, not just the code itself.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n77:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Finally, we'll finish the week with codebase design. You'll learn what makes a codebase easy for agents to work in, from deep modules and enforced boundaries to rescuing legacy code and making it testable.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"By the end of the first week, you'll be able to plan huge chunks of work, trust what comes back, and shape a codebase your agents can find their way around.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n79:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"We'll wrap up Week 1 with Office Hours.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Bring your questions, get direct answers. Can't make it live? Submit your question in advance and get the recording and transcript.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n7a:[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$39:props:children:props:children:24:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"role\":\"separator\",\"className\":\"ah-divider\"}]]\n7b:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Week 2: Feedback Loops and Building Your Factory\"}]\n7c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Week 2 stacks on top of everything you learn in Week 1, introducing the automation that keeps a Software Factory safe and trustworthy at any speed.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n7d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"First, you'll make bad code (nearly) impossible, with automated checks, custom lint rules, mutation testing and verification for frontend apps.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Then for the rest of the week, you'll put it all together and build a Software Factory like mine.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You’ll learn how I use GitHub Actions to automatically investigate, triage, assign, delegate, track and review units of work. And finally, you'll practice designing your own for your codebase and your team.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n80:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Week 2 Office Hours with Matt.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Same format, deeper questions. By now you'll have real experience to draw from, so we can help you connect the dots between your practice and real work in your codebase!\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n81:[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$39:props:children:props:children:24:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"role\":\"separator\",\"className\":\"ah-divider\"}]]\n82:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Works with your favorite harness or model\"}]\n83:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This course focuses on the Claude Code CLI, which is where I've honed these skills and gotten the best results myself. So it's the best way for me to teach you!\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n84:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"But once you've practiced the skills here, you'll be able to use the same techniques and knowledge in just about any CLI coding assistant, with virtually any frontier AI model.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n85:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And the more you practice these skills, the more powerful your software factory can become.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n86:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Learn on your schedule, from anywhere\"}]\n87:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Software Factories for Real Engineers is the most flexible course I've ever offered:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n88:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Instead of being yoked to a semi-daily schedule, you'll receive all lessons on November 9th so you can work ahead or take it slow.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n89:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You'll gain access to 6 live Office Hours across 3 days, staggered for different time zones, to give you the most opportunity to get personal help directly from me. Ask ahead if you can't make it; recordings and transcripts are always included.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n8a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And, of course, you'll get invited to my private AI Hero Discord, with an exclusive channel for you to meet \u0026 learn along with your fellow attendees.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n8b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This way, you get the best of sync and async courses in one great experience.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n8c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"office-hours\"}]\n8e:[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$39:props:children:props:children:24:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"role\":\"separator\",\"className\":\"ah-divider\"}]]\n8f:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Everything included\"}]\n90:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"For $1,295, you'll learn everything you need to design and build a trustworthy and reliable Software Factory of your own.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n91:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Here's what you get when you enroll:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n92:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"All lessons and coding exercises.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Over 60 tight, snappy videos and hands-on practice in a safe sandbox environment. Yours to keep forever.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"The course code repo.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Clone it, reference it, build on it. It's yours.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"My AI Coding Crash Course ($299 value) included FOR FREE.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Instant access to my three-day, self-guided course, available the moment you register so you're ready for Day 1.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Live Office Hours with Matt.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Live Q\u0026A sessions on Monday November 9, Friday November 13, and Friday November 20, with two time-zone friendly options each office hours day. Submit questions in advance if you can't join live.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"All recordings and transcripts.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Every office hours session, captured and available for replay.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Exclusive Discord access.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" Learn alongside your fellow students, ask questions, share wins, and soak up the energy of a group of smart folks figuring things out together.\"]}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}]\n93:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Everything listed here is yours to keep so you can revisit them any time as a reference, as a refresher, or to go deeper with exercises you didn't get to during the cohort.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n94:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Enroll today\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" to gain the skills, workflows, and confidence to use AI coding tools the way they were meant to be used: as a force multiplier for real engineering.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n95:[\"$\",\"$Lae\",null,{\"cohort\":\"$3a:props:cohort\",\"availableBonuses\":\"$3a:props:children:2:props:availableBonuses\",\"purchaseCount\":1573,\"quantityAvailable\":-1,\"totalQuantity\":0,\"product\":\"$10:props:children:props:children:4:props:product\",\"pricingDataLoader\":\"$@ab\",\"hasPurchasedCurrentProduct\":false,\"existingPurchase\":null,\"purchases\":\"$3a:props:children:2:props:purchases\",\"products\":\"$3a:props:children:2:props:products\",\"allowPurchase\":true,\"country\":\"JP\",\"organizationId\":null,\"options\":{\"withTitle\":false,\"withImage\":false},\"userId\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"not-prose my-8 items-center justify-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Laf\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lb0\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 relative h-auto w-full cursor-pointer rounded-lg px-8 font-semibold sm:h-14 sm:w-auto